{"id":"wb-7-1793","name":"袁林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"袁林","text":"袁林，又称袁世凯墓、袁公林，为清末民初重要军事、政治人物，中华民国大总统袁世凯及其夫人于氏的墓葬。袁林位于今中华人民共和国河南省安阳市北关区胜利路，目前建筑格局基本保存完好，是中华人民共和国第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A2%81%E6%9E%97","revisionId":92924138,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92924138","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d6808e014ef0af28078567f8.jpg","title":"20250831_Yuanlin_26.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250831_Yuanlin_26.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/20250831_Yuanlin_26.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安阳 袁林","width":320,"height":213}}